This compilation tape contains recordings of the following events:
Fencing: NYU vs. Notre Dame, January 27, 2002;
Men's Basketball: NYU vs. Case Western Reserve University, January 27, 2002;
Women's Basketball: NYU vs. Case Western Reserve University, January 27, 2002;
Men's Basketball: NYU vs. Stevens Institute of Technology, January 30, 2002.
